    "title": "Thursday football scores | Prep Sports | yakimaherald.com",
    "text": "It's an unusually busy Thursday night of football in the Yakima Valley as teams vie for postseason spots.\nEast Valley's playing at Selah for second-place in the CWAC and Toppenish needs a win at Othello to keep postseason hopes alive. Find out scores for those games and others here.\nCWAC\nSelah 49, East Valley 28\nEllensburg 49, Quincy 6\nProsser 34, Ephrata 7\nOthello 28, Toppenish 28, OT\nSCAC\nZillah 49, Naches Valley 8\nNonleague\nRogers (Spokane) 44, Grandview 14",
